+/// #1109: an open wire run - a cut-off across a 100 x 50 plate at
+/// x = 60, kerf right of travel, SYNTHETIC condition (wire 0.25 mm, gap
+/// 0.04 mm): the wire stands 0.165 mm right of the line, threaded 1 mm
